                    ChangelogChangeType.Changed,
                    "**Nginx reverse proxy** \u2014 `teslasync-web` now acts as both static file server and reverse proxy. The " +
                        "`config.apiEndpoint` Helm value configures the Nginx `proxy_pass` target (defaults to auto-derived " +
                        "`http://<release>-api:<port>`) and is injected into the frontend at runtime via Nginx `sub_filter` as " +
                        "`window.__TESLASYNC_API_BASE__`.",
                ),
                ChangelogChange(
                    ChangelogChangeType.Changed,
                    "**Single-route ingress** \u2014 All traffic now routes through one ingress path (`/`) to `teslasync-web`. " +
